# =============================================================================
# Documented exceptions for the trivy container image scan (issue #2, M6)
#
# Every ID below is a finding in the node:20-alpine BASE IMAGE or in the npm
# build toolchain that ships inside it (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm) -
# none of them are dependencies of the camp-status application itself
# (app deps are covered by the npm audit job, which is clean).
#
# Policy: these are accepted temporarily and must be reviewed at the date
# below. When patched base images are published, remove the relevant lines
# so the gate blocks on them again.
#   review-by: 2027-01-21 (90 days)
#   tracked-by: security gate dashboard (artifact "security-dashboard")
# =============================================================================

# --- alpine 3.23.4 system packages (libssl3 / libcrypto3) -------------------
# openssl DoS via unbounded memory growth in QUIC server
CVE-2026-14456
# openssl heap use-after-free in PKCS7_verify()
CVE-2026-45447

# --- npm toolchain bundled in the base image (build-time only) --------------
